"h":37,"s":25,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"25:50","t":"And We have certainly distributed it among them that they might be reminded, but most of the people refuse except disbelief.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"25:51","t":"And if We had willed, We could have sent into every city a warner.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"25:52","t":"So do not obey the disbelievers, and strive against them with it [i.e., the Qur’ān] a great striving.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"25:53","t":"And it is He who has released [simultaneously] the two seas [i.e., bodies of water], one fresh and sweet and one salty and bitter, and He placed between them a barrier and prohibiting partition.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"25:54","t":"And it is He who has created from water [i.e., semen] a human being and made him [a relative by] lineage and marriage. And ever is your Lord competent [concerning creation].","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"25:55","t":"But they worship rather than Allāh that which does not benefit them or harm them, and the disbeliever is ever, against his Lord, an assistant [to Satan].","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":55,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[25],"sajdah":false}